{"id":"500984","name":"花旗参煲乌鸡汤","author":"草莓","authorId":"19344","desc":"","cover":"images/500984/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"乌鸡","amount":"300g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"花旗参","amount":"15g"},{"name":"黄芪","amount":"5g"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"10g"},{"name":"桂圆","amount":"5g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肉清洗干净。","img":"images/500984/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"乌鸡去内脏清洗干净。","img":"images/500984/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备好黄芪，桂圆，红枣，花旗参。","img":"images/500984/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"砂锅中加入适量开水。","img":"images/500984/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把鸡肉和猪肉倒入锅中。","img":"images/500984/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把洗净的药材倒入锅中。","img":"images/500984/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入两片姜。","img":"images/500984/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上锅盖，小火煮50分钟。","img":"images/500984/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮好后加盐即可。","img":"images/500984/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"煲乌鸡汤加入一点猪肉汤更加甘甜一点，盐最后关火再放。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}